  See also:
    - :func:`jax.numpy.linalg.eig`: computes eigenvalues eigenvectors of a general matrix.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.linalg.eigh`: computes eigenvalues eigenvectors of a Hermitian matrix.

  Notes:
